subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage configuration

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [config] <OPTIONS>       Manage configuration
  get <OPTIONS>            Get a config value
  list <OPTIONS>           List all config values
  reset <OPTIONS>          Reset config to defaults
  set <OPTIONS>            Set a config value

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack config --help
  subtrack config get --help
  subtrack config list --help
  subtrack config reset --help
  subtrack config set --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

